# Docker build context guard (TK-DE445B)
# Without this file `docker build .` would upload node_modules, target/ and the
# local .env to the daemon. Keep the context minimal: only what the four
# Dockerfiles actually COPY.

.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.idea
.vscode

# Build outputs
**/target
**/dist
**/build
coverage
sbom
**/node_modules
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist

# Local state and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Documentation that no build stage needs
docs
*.md
!README.md

# Local orchestration / non-build assets
infra/k8s
infra/scripts
infra/docker-compose.yml
